classDiagram
    %% PawPal+ class diagram — keep updated to match your implementation.

    class Owner {
        +str name
        +list~str~ availability
        +dict preferences
        +change_name(new_name str) None
        +update_availability(availability list) None
        +update_preferences(preferences dict) None
    }

    class Pet {
        +str name
        +str breed
        +list~str~ medications
        +list~str~ allergies
        +str preferred_food
        +list~str~ appointments
        +change_name(new_name str) None
        +update_medication(medication str) None
        +update_appointment(appointment str) None
        +update_allergies(allergy str) None
        +update_food_preference(food str) None
    }

    class Task {
        +str name
        +int duration
        +str priority
        +str deadline
        +Pet pet
        +change_time(duration int) None
        +change_deadline(deadline str) None
    }

    class Schedule {
        +Owner owner
        +list~Pet~ pets
        +list~Task~ tasks
        +str time
        +str status
        +assign_owner(owner Owner) None
        +add_pet(pet Pet) None
        +add_task(task Task) None
        +assign_time(time str) None
        +update_status(status str) None
        +generate_plan() list~Task~
    }

    Owner "1" --> "*" Pet : owns
    Schedule "*" --> "1" Owner : plans for
    Schedule "*" --> "*" Pet : cares for
    Schedule "1" o-- "*" Task : contains
    Task "*" --> "1" Pet : belongs to
